# Every action on a key, without learning a single one.
title Alt+Space opens the menu
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
pre rm -rf .devcontainer
pre lmux create . --layout trio --detach
run lmux create . --nested
wait 4
chapter The menu
caption Alt+Space | every action with its key, and a letter to run it
frame 1.6
keys M-Space
wait 1.4
frame 5
